@page "/"

<PageTitle>RayCraft examples</PageTitle>

<h1>RayCraft examples</h1>
<p>Runnable examples for the free controls of RayCraft.Blazor. Every page has a live example with its source, the parameters, and a note on how it is meant to be used. The code of the library is not in this repository; it comes from the NuGet package.</p>

<ul class="control-list">
    @foreach (var control in ControlCatalog.All)
    {
        <li>
            <a href="@("/controls/" + control.Slug)">@control.Name</a>
            <span>@control.Lead</span>
        </li>
    }
</ul>
